          "quote": "The samples were fabricated using the laser beam with power ( P ) from 200 W to 400 W and scanning speed ( v ) from 600 mm/s to 1400 mm/s. The layer thickness ( d ) was set as 30 μ m, and the scanning distance ( h ) was controlled to 80 μ m.",
          "table": null,
          "figure": null,
          "chunk_id": "5c6c1eb6b4fb99f5:part:001"
        },
        {
          "page": 2,
          "section": "2.1 Materials and processing",
          "quote": "Furthermore, the oxygen content could be restricted to less than 100 ppm under the protection of argon gas during the forming process.",
