        },
        {
          "page": 2,
          "section": "2.1 Materials and processing",
          "quote": "The scanning strategy of LPBF process at the cross section of specimens is illustrated in Fig. 1 (c) and a zig-zag exposure pattern with a 67 ◦ rotation between each layer was used for the inner hatch region.",
